# --- Canonical URL redirects (301) ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Preferred marketing URL for the web design & development service → the canonical page (single URL, no duplicates)
/services/web-design-development    /solutions/website-development    301
/services/web-design-development/   /solutions/website-development    301
# Old "pricing" links: there is no public price list; plan questions go to the contact page.
/pricing    /contact    301
/pricing/   /contact    301
# NOTE: www → apex (https://cintexa.com) is a Cloudflare dashboard setting (Redirect Rules / Bulk Redirects),
# not expressible here. See docs/SEO_AEO_GEO.md.

# --- Client-only app routes ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# These have no prerendered file. They are served the neutral, noindex app shell (NOT the home page) with HTTP 200
# so the React router can take over. Everything else that is not a real file falls through to /404.html, which
# Cloudflare Pages serves with a genuine 404 status — so unknown URLs are no longer soft-404s.
/sign-in           /app-shell/    200
/sign-up           /app-shell/    200
/dashboard         /app-shell/    200
/dashboard/*       /app-shell/    200
/admin             /app-shell/    200
/admin/*           /app-shell/    200
